@page "/projects/taskflow"
@using website.Data


<ProjectPage Url="/projects/taskflow" Kicker="Personal Project">
                <p class="max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
                    A Python framework of more than 10,000 lines that I used to test how far agentic AI tools can go on a large, complex software project.
                </p>

                <!-- Project Origin & Motivation -->
                <ProjectSection Title="Project Origin" Icon="fas fa-lightbulb">
                    <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line mb-6">
                        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                            <div class="bg-cyan-500 rounded-full w-2 h-2 mr-3"></div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">The Challenge</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed italic">
                            "Give me a 10,000-line complex and intricate Python project."
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed">
                        It started as a simple prompt to an AI agent. TaskFlow was first meant to be a component of another project I was building, but I turned it into a personal research project: a way to test AI models against a large, realistic software engineering task in a consistent way. I wanted to push agentic AI hard enough to see where each model held up, where it broke down, and how useful it is in day-to-day development.
                    </p>
                </ProjectSection>

                <!-- System Architecture Deep Dive -->
                <ProjectSection Title="Architecture" Icon="fas fa-sitemap">
                    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">TaskFlow is a distributed task processing system made up of 34 Python modules. These are its main parts:</p>

                    <!-- Core Components -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4 flex items-center">
                                <i class="fas fa-engine mr-3"></i>Task Engine Core
                            </h3>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li><strong>TaskRegistry:</strong> registers task functions automatically through decorators</li>
                                <li><strong>TaskExecutor:</strong> runs async and sync tasks, with timeouts</li>
                                <li><strong>TaskEngine:</strong> the main orchestrator for submitting, cancelling and retrying tasks</li>
                                <li><strong>Health monitoring:</strong> system health checks</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4 flex items-center">
                                <i class="fas fa-database mr-3"></i>Queue Management
                            </h3>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li><strong>Priority queues:</strong> Critical, High, Normal and Low</li>
                                <li><strong>Delayed execution:</strong> scheduled, cron-like tasks</li>
                                <li><strong>Connections:</strong> reconnects automatically with exponential backoff</li>
                                <li><strong>Live statistics:</strong> performance metrics and monitoring</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4 flex items-center">
                                <i class="fas fa-users mr-3"></i>Worker System
                            </h3>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li><strong>Distributed processing:</strong> several workers run tasks in parallel</li>
                                <li><strong>Concurrency:</strong> worker pool sizes are configurable</li>
                                <li><strong>Queue specialization:</strong> workers can be tied to specific queues</li>
                                <li><strong>Recovery:</strong> workers are monitored and restarted automatically</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4 flex items-center">
                                <i class="fas fa-globe mr-3"></i>API & Web Interface
                            </h3>
                            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm">
                                <li><strong>FastAPI backend:</strong> a REST API for the whole system</li>
                                <li><strong>WebSockets:</strong> live updates and notifications</li>
                                <li><strong>Web dashboard:</strong> watch and manage tasks as they run</li>
                                <li><strong>Health endpoints:</strong> system status and diagnostics</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Advanced Features -->
                    <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">Features</h3>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Reliability & Recovery</h4>
                                <ul class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1">
                                    <li>• Automatic retry with exponential backoff</li>
                                    <li>• Circuit breakers to isolate failures</li>
                                    <li>• Task dependency management</li>
                                    <li>• Error handling throughout</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Monitoring & Observability</h4>
                                <ul class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1">
                                    <li>• Prometheus metrics on port 8001</li>
                                    <li>• Structured JSON logging</li>
                                    <li>• Correlation ID tracking</li>
                                    <li>• Live WebSocket updates</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Management & Operations</h4>
                                <ul class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1">
                                    <li>• A CLI with 20+ admin commands</li>
                                    <li>• Configuration through environment variables</li>
                                    <li>• Database migrations and schema management</li>
                                    <li>• Horizontal scaling</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </ProjectSection>

                <!-- Technical Implementation Details -->
                <ProjectSection Title="Implementation Highlights" Icon="fas fa-code">
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Configuration Management</h3>
                            <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4">
                                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3">More than 60 settings, including:</p>
                                <ul class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1">
                                    <li>• Database connection pool tuning</li>
                                    <li>• Redis clustering and persistence</li>
                                    <li>• Worker concurrency and timeouts</li>
                                    <li>• Security (JWT, API keys, CORS)</li>
                                    <li>• Monitoring and logging</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Deployment & Scaling</h3>
                            <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4">
                                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3">Ways to deploy it:</p>
                                <ul class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1">
                                    <li>• Docker containers</li>
                                    <li>• Kubernetes manifests included</li>
                                    <li>• Docker Compose for running all the services together</li>
                                    <li>• Horizontal scaling</li>
                                    <li>• Load balancing and service discovery</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Code Examples -->
                    <div class="mt-6">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Usage Patterns</h3>
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4 font-mono text-sm">
                            <div class="text-cy mb-2"># Task Definition</div>
                            <div class="text-gray-300 mb-4">
                                <span class="text-cy">@@task</span>(name=<span class="text-cy">"data_processor"</span>, queue=<span class="text-cy">"data_processing"</span>, timeout=<span class="text-cy">300</span>)<br/>
                                <span class="text-cy">async def</span> <span class="text-cy">process_data</span>(data):<br/>
                                    <span class="text-cy">return</span> {<span class="text-cy">"processed"</span>: <span class="text-cy">len</span>(data)}
                            </div>
                            <div class="text-cy mb-2"># CLI Administration</div>
                            <div class="text-gray-300">
                                python main.py worker start --queues default,high --concurrency 4<br/>
                                python main.py task submit my_task --args '[1,2,3]' --queue high_priority
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </ProjectSection>

                <!-- AI Model Performance Analysis -->
                <ProjectSection Title="AI Model Performance Analysis" Icon="fas fa-robot">
                    <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line mb-6">
                        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                            <div class="bg-cy/10 rounded-full w-3 h-3 mr-3"></div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">Research Findings</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                            I gave the models the same set of complex engineering tasks. <strong>Claude Code Pro</strong> did clearly better than Gemini CLI at architectural reasoning, code quality and keeping the system design consistent. Its reasoning held up well on enterprise-style patterns, async code and distributed system design. I'm still evaluating Qwen Code; early tests look promising for optimization and performance tuning.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                            <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                                <div class="bg-cy/10 rounded-full w-3 h-3 mr-3"></div>
                                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">Claude Code Pro</h3>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mb-3">
                                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                                    <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Architecture Design</span>
                                    <div class="flex">
                                        <i class="fas fa-star text-cy"></i>
                                        <i class="fas fa-star text-cy"></i>
                                        <i class="fas fa-star text-cy"></i>
                                        <i class="fas fa-star text-cy"></i>
                                        <i class="fas fa-star text-cy"></i>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Very strong at system architecture and async patterns. It also wrote thorough documentation and kept a large codebase well organized.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                            <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                                <div class="bg-cy/10 rounded-full w-3 h-3 mr-3"></div>
                                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">Gemini CLI</h3>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mb-3">
                                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                                    <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">API Development</span>
                                    <div class="flex">
                                        <i class="fas fa-star text-cy"></i>
                                        <i class="fas fa-star text-cy"></i>
                                        <i class="fas fa-star text-cy"></i>
                                        <i class="far fa-star text-gray-600"></i>
                                        <i class="far fa-star text-gray-600"></i>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Good at database schema design and building API endpoints, but less consistent on bigger architectural decisions.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line">
                            <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                                <div class="bg-cy/10 rounded-full w-3 h-3 mr-3"></div>
                                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">Qwen Code</h3>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mb-3">
                                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                                    <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Under Evaluation</span>
                                    <div class="flex">
                                        <i class="fas fa-hourglass-half text-cy"></i>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Early tests show potential in performance optimization and monitoring. The full evaluation is still in progress.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </ProjectSection>

                <!-- Key Insights & Technologies Grid -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                    <!-- Key Insights -->
                    <ProjectSection Title="Key Insights" Icon="fas fa-lightbulb">
                        <ul class="space-y-3">
                            <li class="flex items-start">
                                <span class="text-cy mr-3 mt-1">•</span>
