                            <li class="flex items-start">
                                <span class="text-cy mr-3 mt-1">•</span>
                                <span class="text-gray-300">Designing and building a distributed system that scales</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex items-start">
                                <span class="text-cy mr-3 mt-1">•</span>
